			],
			"Message": "style(Deps): Replace Unicode EM QUAD with HTML entity in README links\n\nThe README.md in Land/Dependency used literal Unicode U+2001 (EM QUAD) characters for spacing between repository names and emoji badges. Replace all occurrences with the explicit HTML entity `&#x2001;` to ensure consistent rendering across browsers and markdown viewers.\n\nAffects 24 repository link entries covering Echo, Land, Element, Mountain, River, Sky, Sun, Wind, Dependency, Editor, and the Microsoft/Tauri/OXC/Biome Cargo/NPM/Dependency sub-repositories. No semantic content changes — only encoding normalization for reliable whitespace display.",
